SAM3 visual segmentation over an existing run artifact. It never renders a new camera view. Provide exactly one text prompt or single positive point. A successful top-ranked mask is projected through the matching world map to produce world_xyz.

exec tool declaration:
```ts
declare const tools: { mcp__rpent__segment(args: {
  // Artifact camera to use (default agentview).
  camera?: "agentview" | "wrist";
  // Minimum accepted mask score (default 0.2).
  min_score?: number;
  // Optional single positive point as [row, col]. Mutually exclusive with prompt.
  point?: Array<number> | null;
  // Object/text prompt to segment.
  prompt?: string;
  // Step to segment; -1 = latest.
  step?: number;
}): Promise<CallToolResult>; };
```

